<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 25.34 to 6036.46.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.31 to 375.91.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.03.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1261 to 1061.</p>
<p>Volume was 439,636,340, compared with 410,680,580 Tuesday.</p>
